OL,3,AUS to ban imports of some Canadian
OL,4,Aalcohol, dairy goods and motorbikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US will ban imports of a range of
OL,7,FCanadian products, including alcoholic
OL,8,Fspirits, some dairy goods and
OL,9,Fmotorbikes, after its neighbour's
OL,10,Fretaliatory tariffs on American goods
OL,11,Fcame into force.
OL,13,FIn a series of executive orders on
OL,14,FTuesday, President Donald Trump said
OL,15,FCanada was "discriminating" against the
OL,16,FUS and outlined the bans, which will
OL,17,Fbegin on 29 September.
OL,19,FOfficials on both sides have said they
OL,20,Fwould like to strike a trade deal, but
OL,21,Fno new talks have been scheduled since
OL,22,Fnegotiations collapsed in late August.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
