OL,3,APrince William joins royals and
OL,4,Adiplomats in Oslo to pay final tribute
OL,5,Ato late King Harald V
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince of Wales joins European
OL,8,Froyals and diplomats in Norway's
OL,9,Fcapital Oslo for the funeral of King
OL,10,FHarald V - watch live coverage above
OL,12,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,13,F35 years on the throne - his son,
OL,14,FHaakon VIII, has succeeded him
OL,16,FA funeral procession took the king's
OL,17,Fcasket from the Royal Palace to Oslo
OL,18,FCathedral, where a service is now
OL,19,Ftaking place in Norwegian. He will then
OL,20,Fbe laid to rest at Akershus Fortress
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
