OL,3,APrince William joins royals and
OL,4,Adiplomats in Oslo to pay final tribute
OL,5,Ato late King Harald V
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince William is representing King
OL,8,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,9,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,10,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,12,FThe King and Queen of Denmark,
OL,13,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,14,Fand King Abdullah II of Jordan are also
OL,15,Fin Oslo, with large crowds gathered for
OL,16,Fthe farewell
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
